# Golden fixtures are byte-level contracts (ADR 0006): the contracted
# format has bare `\n` line endings, so git must never rewrite theirs —
# a Windows checkout with `core.autocrlf=true` would turn the committed
# LF endings into CRLF and fail the byte-for-byte golden test. Keep the
# fixtures LF in every working tree, on every platform.
*.csv text eol=lf
